<title>UK: UK's Standard Life Assurance expands into Austria.</title>
<headline>UK's Standard Life Assurance expands into Austria.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British mutual insurance company Standard Life Assurance Co said on Tuesday it had been granted a licence to sell its products in Austria.</p>
<p>Standard, which will initially sell annuities, will cooperate with Austrian broker MFV to build distribution, the company said in a statement. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
